Q: css3 background radial circle gradient A: <pre class="lang-css prettyprint-override"><code>background: -webkit-radial-gradient(circle, #e4122f 0%, #ff0000 0%, #cc1515 25%, #c40000 32%, #f01818 33%);
background: -moz-radial-gradient(circle, #e4122f 0%, #ff0000 0%, #cc1515 25%, #c40000 32%, #f01818 33%);
background: radial-gradient(circle, #e4122f 0%, #ff0000 0%, #cc1515 25%, #c40000 32%, #f01818 33%);
</code></pre>
